    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/cb71791bee5cdb5c7eb2233286769fe3.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=180 /></span><br>Sheep strapped to rockets and jetpacks star in this precision platformer with a focus on speed running and level routing. Learn to harness and perfect the highly tuned controls to reach the goals in record time. Every sheep has dreamed of touching the stars, will you be the first?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/777d7532c7fe032e3f10058baecb9eb7.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/28970c41cecac870310611d3f65f4c47.poster.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/28970c41cecac870310611d3f65f4c47.webm?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/28970c41cecac870310611d3f65f4c47.mp4?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Precision platformer featuring PvP multiplayer party-game modes. Challenge friends and open lobbies to rocket-powered sheep races.  Be the first to the end for points, utilize catchup mechanics, add crazy modifiers and more.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/3734cc859a977751a8ecae29288ac79c.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/7d3dfc1daecbb48d24c498dac1d3beec.poster.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/7d3dfc1daecbb48d24c498dac1d3beec.webm?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/7d3dfc1daecbb48d24c498dac1d3beec.mp4?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tackle the single player campaign and challenges casually, or attempt to achieve S-Rank times and build your skills. Take on the challenge mode for the ultimate test of your mastery.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/2f68100faeb741c3f096092397c4c181.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/6b97f78842710701bdfd9d29b9833426.poster.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/6b97f78842710701bdfd9d29b9833426.webm?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/6b97f78842710701bdfd9d29b9833426.mp4?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Customize your sheep with an assortment of rockets, jetpacks, silly hats, and colors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rage / Precision platformer with escalating challenges<br></li><li> Multiplayer lobbies with friends or take your chances with open lobbies<br></li><li> Multiple difficulty modes to suit beginners and pros alike<br></li><li> Highly customizable multiplayer gameplay for everyone<br></li><li> Many customizable cosmetics<br></li><li> Challenge / Speedrun mode for the ones looking for maximum challenge<br></li><li> Simple to learn, difficult to master</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/cb71791bee5cdb5c7eb2233286769fe3.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=180 /></span><br>Sheep strapped to rockets and jetpacks star in this precision platformer with a focus on speed running and level routing. Learn to harness and perfect the highly tuned controls to reach the goals in record time. Every sheep has dreamed of touching the stars, will you be the first?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/777d7532c7fe032e3f10058baecb9eb7.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/28970c41cecac870310611d3f65f4c47.poster.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/28970c41cecac870310611d3f65f4c47.webm?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/28970c41cecac870310611d3f65f4c47.mp4?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Precision platformer featuring PvP multiplayer party-game modes. Challenge friends and open lobbies to rocket-powered sheep races.  Be the first to the end for points, utilize catchup mechanics, add crazy modifiers and more.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/3734cc859a977751a8ecae29288ac79c.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/7d3dfc1daecbb48d24c498dac1d3beec.poster.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/7d3dfc1daecbb48d24c498dac1d3beec.webm?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/7d3dfc1daecbb48d24c498dac1d3beec.mp4?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tackle the single player campaign and challenges casually, or attempt to achieve S-Rank times and build your skills. Take on the challenge mode for the ultimate test of your mastery.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/2f68100faeb741c3f096092397c4c181.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/6b97f78842710701bdfd9d29b9833426.poster.avif?t=1755539864\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/6b97f78842710701bdfd9d29b9833426.webm?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/6b97f78842710701bdfd9d29b9833426.mp4?t=1755539864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Customize your sheep with an assortment of rockets, jetpacks, silly hats, and colors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rage / Precision platformer with escalating challenges<br></li><li> Multiplayer lobbies with friends or take your chances with open lobbies<br></li><li> Multiple difficulty modes to suit beginners and pros alike<br></li><li> Highly customizable multiplayer gameplay for everyone<br></li><li> Many customizable cosmetics<br></li><li> Challenge / Speedrun mode for the ones looking for maximum challenge<br></li><li> Simple to learn, difficult to master</li></ul>",
